Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.67,0:00:19.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.17,0:00:38.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chirrido de insectos]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:52.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chirrido de insectos se intensifica]
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.42,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.38,0:01:00.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mamá!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:02.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadea]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:05.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Qué pasó? - [Leonor] A ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.92,0:01:05.67,中文,,0,0,0,,让我看看
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.46,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我要死了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.46,0:01:08.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mamá, ¿me voy a morir?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [ríe] Todo lo contrario, Remedios. - [ríen]
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.54,0:01:11.50,中文,,0,0,0,,恰恰相反 蕾梅黛丝
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.04,0:01:15.96,中文,,0,0,0,,《百年孤独》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:18.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de zarzuela]
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.17,中文,,0,0,0,,虽然颇费了一番心力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.83,0:01:57.50,中文,,0,0,0,,但到了择定的婚礼那日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.83,0:01:57.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero en la fecha prevista,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.58,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝已然如所有姐姐一般
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.17,0:02:00.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Remedios era tan diestra en las cosas del mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.67,0:02:02.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,como cualquiera de sus hermanas.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.79,0:02:02.71,中文,,0,0,0,,通晓人情世故
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:06.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tocan la puerta]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.46,中文,,0,0,0,,另一方面 奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.83,0:02:13.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.83,中文,,0,0,0,,正穿着几年以后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:15.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,vestido con los mismos botines
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:19.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que había de llevar pocos años después frente al pelotón de fusilamiento,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.00,0:02:18.21,中文,,0,0,0,,在面临行刑队时
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.29,0:02:19.88,中文,,0,0,0,,穿的同一双靴子
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.46,中文,,0,0,0,,紧张得说不出话来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.83,0:02:22.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,tenía una bola en la garganta.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.88,中文,,0,0,0,,你还是一如既往地帅气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estás más bello que nunca.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.38,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y Rebeca?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Mmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.12,0:02:35.96,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.12,0:02:35.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música de zarzuela continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.29,0:02:51.08,中文,,0,0,0,,按照乌苏拉原本的安排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:51.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.62,0:02:53.83,中文,,0,0,0,,今天也是丽贝卡的成婚之日…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:53.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca se casaría en la misma fecha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:56.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Visitación] Niña Rebeca, la buscan.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.58,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡小姐 有人来看你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.83,0:02:58.38,中文,,0,0,0,,…但就在前一晚
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.88,0:03:03.00,中文,,0,0,0,,彼得罗·克莱斯皮收到一封信信中说他的母亲朱莉娅
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:03.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pietro Crespi recibió una carta anunciando la muerte inminente de Giulia,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.46,中文,,0,0,0,,生命垂危
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:04.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,su madre,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.17,0:03:07.42,中文,,0,0,0,,于是他即刻动身去了首都
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.17,0:03:07.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y partió a la capital de inmediato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Rebeca llora]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:15.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.46,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.67,0:03:21.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你比彼得罗信中描述的还要美丽百倍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:21.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] Ni siquiera las cartas de Pietro te hacían tan hermosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.00,中文,,0,0,0,,朱莉娅？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:23.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Giulia?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.12,中文,,0,0,0,,彼得罗在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.12,0:03:28.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] ¿Dónde está Pietro?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.88,中文,,0,0,0,,我想在婚礼开始前见一见他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] Quiero verlo antes de la ceremonia.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.79,中文,,0,0,0,,你不会就穿这身去参加婚礼吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.08,0:03:34.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] Y no irás así vestida a la boda, ¿verdad?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadea]
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.17,中文,,0,0,0,,看这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.29,0:03:48.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aquí.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.25,0:03:50.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Rebeca llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.88,0:03:56.38,中文,,0,0,0,,无论在何处 人都不应压抑地生活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:54.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] Nunca debes someter a la vida
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,en todas partes.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.58,0:04:00.88,中文,,0,0,0,,生活
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:00.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Vida. - Mmm…
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.08,中文,,0,0,0,,今天不行 何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:09.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] Hoy no, José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.67,中文,,0,0,0,,今天别胡闹
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hoy no, ¿mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.75,0:04:13.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave alegre]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:33.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.04,中文,,0,0,0,,婚礼是最简单的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.42,0:04:43.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula] Lo de menos es la boda.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.29,中文,,0,0,0,,放轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.71,0:04:45.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya. Tranquilo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.33,0:05:13.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:18.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:21.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.75,0:05:28.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:31.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[padre reza en voz baja]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.21,0:05:37.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.29,0:05:39.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] …lo importante que debería ser el amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:44.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.62,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺 拿着戒指 重复我说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:46.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aureliano, toma el anillo. Repite conmigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.12,中文,,0,0,0,,我 奥…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.62,0:05:49.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Yo, Au… - [exclamaciones]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.17,0:05:52.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[mujer] Se cayó el anillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.62,0:05:54.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.54,0:06:04.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chirrido de insectos]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:14.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ulular de búho]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:21.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suspira]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:31.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[exclamaciones]
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.46,0:06:33.83,中文,,0,0,0,,从那天起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.46,0:06:33.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.96,0:06:38.00,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝便已展现出
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.96,0:06:38.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se reveló la gracia natural y el reposado dominio
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.96,中文,,0,0,0,,面对逆境时永远镇定自若的从容和优雅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.08,0:06:40.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que siempre había de tener Remedios ante la adversidad.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我 奥雷里亚诺·布恩迪亚 愿娶你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.62,0:06:44.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo, Aureliano Buendía, te quiero a ti…
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.38,中文,,0,0,0,,我 奥雷里亚诺·布恩迪亚 愿娶你…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo, Aureliano Buendía, te quiero a ti…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.46,0:06:49.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…Remedios Moscote, como mi esposa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.67,0:06:49.58,中文,,0,0,0,,…蕾梅黛丝·摩斯科特为妻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.67,0:06:51.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…Remedios Moscote, como mi esposa.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.83,0:06:51.58,中文,,0,0,0,,…蕾梅黛丝·摩斯科特为妻
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我发誓对你忠诚不渝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y me entrego a ti…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.29,0:06:54.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y me entrego a ti…
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.46,0:06:54.46,中文,,0,0,0,,我发誓对你忠诚不渝
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.67,中文,,0,0,0,,直至死亡将我们分开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:56.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…hasta que la muerte nos separe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:58.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…hasta que la muerte nos separe.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.50,中文,,0,0,0,,直至死亡将我们分开
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.17,0:07:07.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我 蕾梅黛丝·摩斯科特 愿接受你奥雷里亚诺·布恩迪亚作为我的丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.17,0:07:03.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo, Remedios Moscote,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:07.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,te quiero a ti, Aureliano Buendía, como mi esposo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.04,0:07:13.17,中文,,0,0,0,,无论疾病还是健康我发誓对你忠诚不渝
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:09.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me entrego a ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:13.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Prometo serte fiel en la salud y en la enfermedad,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.25,中文,,0,0,0,,直至死亡将我们分开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.67,0:07:15.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,hasta que la muerte nos separe.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.38,0:07:20.67,中文,,0,0,0,,-你做了什么？-愿你们的结合为大家做个表率
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:19.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Qué hiciste? - [padre] Que esta unión sea un ejemplo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:20.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- para todos. - Shh…
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.33,中文,,0,0,0,,使一切沿着正确的道路进行下去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Para que se mantengan del lado que deben ser las cosas,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.58,0:07:29.00,中文,,0,0,0,,正如阿波利纳·摩斯科特先生将教会带到了马孔多一样
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:29.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,tal y como don Apolinar Moscote nos trajo aquí a Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.62,0:07:33.17,中文,,0,0,0,,我现在宣布你们结为夫妻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.62,0:07:33.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ahora los declaro marido y mujer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.92,0:07:36.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [aplausos] - [Rebeca llora]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:42.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.54,中文,,0,0,0,,-这场婚礼他们办得很尽心-是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:46.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[mujer] Aventó la casa por la ventana.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.08,0:07:50.83,中文,,0,0,0,,那边是马尔克和维斯巴家的人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.08,0:07:50.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y por aquí los Márquez y los Visbales.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.88,中文,,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:54.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[padre] Buenas noches.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.21,中文,,0,0,0,,听说你们是小镇的开创者之一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.17,0:07:58.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Son algunos de los fundadores, tengo entendido.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Así es.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.42,0:08:00.71,中文,,0,0,0,,没错 我是盖里奈多·马尔克
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Gerineldo Márquez. - Encantado.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.79,0:08:01.71,中文,,0,0,0,,幸会
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.79,0:08:05.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno, el padre Nicanor Reyna nos ha hecho el honor
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.12,中文,,0,0,0,,尼卡诺·雷纳神父放下在圣玛尔塔传福音的工作
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.21,0:08:09.12,中文,,0,0,0,,专程前来马孔多我们真是三生有幸呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:09.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de dejar sus actividades espirituales en Santa Marta para venir a acompañarnos.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.21,0:08:13.33,中文,,0,0,0,,摩斯科特夫人 您这么说可折煞我了相信我 这是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:13.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No, doña Leonor, no diga eso, que el honor es enteramente mío, créanme.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.33,0:08:16.33,中文,,0,0,0,,-你好-幸会 我是伊莎贝尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.33,0:08:16.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Cómo está? - Mucho gusto. Isabel.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.58,中文,,0,0,0,,您认为这座小镇如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:18.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y cómo le ha parecido el pueblo?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.83,0:08:22.54,中文,,0,0,0,,跟想象中一样好 当然如今有了神的临在 更是锦上添花了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.83,0:08:22.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Se imaginarán. Ahora que está Dios, muchísimo mejor, por supuesto. [ríe]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:23.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Gerineldo resopla]
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.00,中文,,0,0,0,,-跟我来-谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Venga, por aquí. - Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.08,0:08:27.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- No. ¿Cómo se le ocurre a este? - [Matilde] Cálmate.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.21,0:08:27.79,中文,,0,0,0,,-他以为自己是谁啊？-冷静点 别激动
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:29.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.17,0:09:02.33,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉女士您凭一己之力维持着这个家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.17,0:09:02.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No quiero imaginar todo lo que ha tenido que hacer, doña Úrsula,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.42,0:09:04.54,中文,,0,0,0,,真难以想象那是何等的操劳
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.42,0:09:04.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para sostener esta familia sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.25,中文,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 我劳碌惯了 尼卡诺先生
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:10.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Menos mal he trabajado toda la vida, don Nicanor.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.17,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.33,0:09:11.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.96,中文,,0,0,0,,我还是会为二位祈祷的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.79,0:09:14.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno, oraré por ambos, de todas formas.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.54,中文,,0,0,0,,别担心 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.79,0:09:17.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] No te preocupes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.71,0:09:20.54,中文,,0,0,0,,彼得罗一定会回来娶你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.71,0:09:20.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estoy segura de que Pietro regresará y se casará contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.62,0:09:24.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你们的婚姻一定会幸福美满真是天造地设的一对儿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:22.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Será un matrimonio bellísimo, estoy segura.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.83,0:09:24.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hacen una pareja maravillosa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.83,0:09:27.50,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡！你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.83,0:09:30.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música de piano suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.54,中文,,0,0,0,,那封该死的信是你寄的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] Tú mandaste esa maldita carta.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca… ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.75,0:09:38.00,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡 别闹
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我选择了最温和的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.88,0:09:40.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Era lo menos grave que podía hacer.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.33,中文,,0,0,0,,另一个选项是杀死你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.79,0:09:43.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La otra salida era matarte.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.83,0:09:48.00,中文,,0,0,0,,-阿玛兰妲 能跟我跳支舞吗？-当然
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.83,0:09:48.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Amaranta, ¿bailamos? - Claro.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.96,0:09:50.79,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:50.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.88,中文,,0,0,0,,我妈妈在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mi madre, ¿dónde está?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.92,中文,,0,0,0,,现在办婚礼也不迟
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:37.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Todavía nos podemos casar.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.17,0:10:40.58,中文,,0,0,0,,尼卡诺神父还没走
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.17,0:10:40.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El padre Nicanor sigue aquí.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.75,中文,,0,0,0,,婚纱也还在 万事俱备了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.00,0:10:42.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Está el vestido, todo está montado…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, sin ella no puedo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.21,中文,,0,0,0,,她不在场 我不能结婚
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.58,中文,,0,0,0,,她绝不会原谅我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No me lo perdonaría jamás.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.96,0:10:48.79,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.96,0:10:48.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:52.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música inquietante]
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.67,0:10:58.04,中文,,0,0,0,,我们会相守一生的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:58.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] Vamos a estar juntos toda la vida.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.33,中文,,0,0,0,,只是时间早晚的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:00.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es solo cuestión de tiempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[tictac del reloj]
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.21,0:11:20.08,中文,,0,0,0,,一个人不是在该死的时候死而是在能死的时候死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.21,0:11:20.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] Uno no se muere cuando debe, sino cuando puede.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.17,0:11:22.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Uno no se "mueres" cuando debe, sino cuando puede.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.25,0:11:22.67,中文,,0,0,0,,一个人不是在改死的时候死而是在能死的时候死
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.58,中文,,0,0,0,,一个人不是在该死的时候死…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Uno no se muere cuando debe…
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.25,中文,,0,0,0,,一个人不是在该死的时候死…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:28.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Uno no se muere cuando debe…
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.00,中文,,0,0,0,,…而是在能死的时候死
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:30.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…sino cuando puede.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.08,0:11:31.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…sino cuando puede.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.42,中文,,0,0,0,,…而是在能死的时候死
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.83,0:11:34.79,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝投入到了照料何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.83,0:11:34.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] la dispendiosa tarea
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.04,中文,,0,0,0,,这项繁琐的工作中 并且乐此不疲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.88,0:11:37.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de atender a José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.83,0:11:41.83,中文,,0,0,0,,她会把他的头发和胡子里的虱子都清理干净
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:41.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Le mantenía limpio de piojos los cabellos y la barba,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.54,中文,,0,0,0,,在生命的最后几个月里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:44.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y en los últimos meses
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.38,中文,,0,0,0,,她甚至能与他进行交流了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:47.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,había logrado comunicarse con él.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.17,中文,,0,0,0,,恐惧？害怕？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.54,0:11:49.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:50.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B. ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.33,中文,,0,0,0,,你不怕他吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] ¿Acaso no le temes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.12,0:11:55.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave]
Dialogue: 10,0:11:57.96,0:12:01.33,中文,,0,0,0,,小蚂蚁 往这边走就不会被人发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.96,0:12:01.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios en español] Si pasan por acá, nadie las ve, hormiguitas.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.25,中文,,0,0,0,,但是走那条路的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:03.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero si se quedan de ese lado…
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.04,0:12:04.88,中文,,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:04.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Cuidado!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.17,0:12:07.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.75,0:12:12.79,中文,,0,0,0,,明白了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.75,0:12:12.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Sí ven?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.25,0:12:19.21,中文,,0,0,0,,她宛如一缕令人愉悦的清风吹进了布恩迪亚家的门墙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.25,0:12:16.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:19.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,trajo un soplo de alegría a los Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.29,0:12:22.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula] Remedios, ven, vamos a aprender a hacer los caramelitos.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.42,0:12:22.50,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝 过来 我们一起学做糖果
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.67,0:12:28.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios] ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.17,0:12:32.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.96,中文,,0,0,0,,孩子 你唱歌真好听
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.42,0:12:34.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula] Ay, mija. Qué lindo cantas.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.58,0:12:40.54,中文,,0,0,0,,整间屋子都洋溢着她那蓬勃的朝气
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:40.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] desbordaba las paredes de la casa…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.62,0:12:42.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[suena música de piano alegre]
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.58,0:12:46.21,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡·布恩迪亚小姐我能与你共舞此曲吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:46.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Señorita Rebeca Buendía, ¿me concede esta pieza?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ríen]
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.46,中文,,0,0,0,,一、二、三
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios] Un, dos, tres. Un, dos, tres.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.75,中文,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:09.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Muy bien! ¡Y… vuelta!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.04,中文,,0,0,0,,现在转圈！
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.71,0:13:11.29,中文,,0,0,0,,非常好！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:11.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Muy bien! [ríe]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:15.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [música suave] - [Remedios susurra] Buenos días, mundo.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.04,0:13:15.67,中文,,0,0,0,,早上好 美丽的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:19.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] de buena salud por los corredores.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.96,0:13:19.29,中文,,0,0,0,,她穿过回廊时就像一阵活泼健康的旋风
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.83,中文,,0,0,0,,-早上好 何塞·阿卡蒂奥-早上好 蕾梅黛丝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [en latín] Buen día, don José Arcadio. - ¡Buen día, Remedios!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.42,0:13:34.83,中文,,0,0,0,,早上好 比希塔森
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.42,0:13:36.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [en español] Buenos días, Visitación. - Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.92,0:13:35.75,中文,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.38,0:13:50.04,中文,,0,0,0,,早上好 乌苏拉女士
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.38,0:13:50.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Buenos días, doña Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.50,中文,,0,0,0,,早上好 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:52.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Buenos días, mi niña.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:55.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios tararea]
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.62,0:14:20.71,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺在她身上找到了生活的动力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:17.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:20.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,la motivación que le hacía falta para vivir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:25.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música cesa]
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这是你做的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:29.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Lo hiciste tú?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.21,中文,,0,0,0,,这是我的私人空间
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Este lugar es privado.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.83,0:14:37.08,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.83,0:14:37.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Disculpa, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.29,中文,,0,0,0,,我是来送咖啡的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pensé que te gustaría un café.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.88,0:14:43.88,中文,,0,0,0,,她是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:43.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:45.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.21,0:14:45.00,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.08,0:14:48.46,中文,,0,0,0,,…阿卡蒂奥在临死前最后一个想到的人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.08,0:14:48.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,…la última persona en la que pensó Arcadio antes de morir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:54.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.62,0:15:06.00,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝 不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.62,0:15:06.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio] Remedios, quieta.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.83,中文,,0,0,0,,之前没告诉你是因为不想毁了你的婚姻
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.88,0:15:43.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te lo dije antes porque no quería dañarte el matrimonio.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.12,0:15:48.12,中文,,0,0,0,,我知道这会给你带来麻烦奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:48.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo sé que es un problema, Aureliano,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.67,中文,,0,0,0,,但我已经有两个儿子了 他该有个家
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero yo ya tengo dos hijos, y él se merece una familia.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.04,中文,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.08,0:15:57.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.08,0:15:58.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我会照顾他的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:58.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me haré cargo.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.54,中文,,0,0,0,,但你不该这么贸然出现
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.29,0:16:04.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero no debiste llegar así, sin avisar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.92,0:16:29.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[pasos se alejan]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.67,0:16:34.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [puerta se abre y se cierra] - [solloza]
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.62,0:16:37.17,中文,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.62,0:16:37.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano susurra] Todo está bien. Todo está bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.08,中文,,0,0,0,,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:42.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Amor mío.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[diálogo indistinto]
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.67,0:16:49.54,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:49.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Aureliano!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么能做出这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.75,0:17:08.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo se te ocurre, Aureliano?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:09.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Mmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.46,0:17:14.67,中文,,0,0,0,,这是在我向蕾梅黛丝求婚前发生的事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.46,0:17:14.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Esto pasó… antes de pedir la mano de Remedios.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.71,中文,,0,0,0,,那不重要！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.75,0:17:15.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y qué importa?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你要让她帮你养一个野种吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.92,0:17:23.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿La pondrás a criar a un bastardo?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.67,0:17:26.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.67,0:17:26.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué dijiste?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.21,中文,,0,0,0,,那孩子会冠上布恩迪亚的姓氏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.79,0:17:35.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Este niño va a llevar el apellido Buendía…
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.17,0:17:40.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你仔细听好了 乌苏拉·伊瓜兰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.17,0:17:40.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque escúchame bien, Úrsula Iguarán.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.83,0:17:44.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我绝不允许你像对待阿卡蒂奥那样对他！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.83,0:17:44.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Jamás te permitiré que lo trates de la misma manera que trataste a Arcadio!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.25,中文,,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:47.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.29,0:17:52.88,中文,,0,0,0,,那就看看她和她的父母得知你有了个儿子会怎么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.29,0:17:52.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Veremos qué dicen ella y tus suegros cuando se enteren de que tienes un hijo.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我们走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:56.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vamos a ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.67,0:17:59.54,中文,,0,0,0,,好 走着瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.67,0:17:59.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vamos a ver.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.79,0:18:04.29,中文,,0,0,0,,他有名字了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:04.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Apolinar] ¿Y ya tiene nombre?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.54,中文,,0,0,0,,就以我和我哥哥的名字命名
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:06.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Llevará el mío y el de mi hermano.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.71,0:18:08.96,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺·何塞
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:08.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aureliano José.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我明天会说服尼卡诺给他行受浸礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:15.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Convenceré a Nicanor para que lo bautice mañana mismo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.83,0:18:18.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Con que Dios lo bendiga y esto quede entre nosotros,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.00,0:18:18.42,中文,,0,0,0,,只要有上帝的祝福并严守他身世的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:19.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,no creo que haya problema.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.83,0:18:21.54,中文,,0,0,0,,便不成问题 同意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.67,0:18:21.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿De acuerdo?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,De acuerdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.50,0:18:29.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.75,0:18:32.38,中文,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到神的国度
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.75,0:18:32.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Bienvenido seas al reino del Señor.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.62,中文,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.33,中文,,0,0,0,,抱紧他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano] Sostenlo con fuerza.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.33,中文,,0,0,0,,您会在镇上待多久 神父？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.46,0:18:55.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y hasta cuándo se queda en el pueblo, padre?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.83,0:18:58.83,中文,,0,0,0,,我们想趁您还在时筹划好婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.83,0:18:59.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pietro y yo quisiéramos aprovechar que está acá para organizar nuestra boda.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.33,0:19:01.08,中文,,0,0,0,,不用着急 亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.33,0:19:01.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No tienes que afanarte, querida,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.62,中文,,0,0,0,,尼卡诺神父决定留下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.17,0:19:03.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque el padre Nicanor ha decidido quedarse.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.88,0:19:09.33,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉女士 你们在这偏僻之地所建立的一切 实在令人叹服
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.88,0:19:09.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es increíble lo que han logrado aquí en medio de la nada, doña Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.38,中文,,0,0,0,,但让我惊讶的是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo que a mí me sorprende
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.04,中文,,0,0,0,,自小镇成立的30年以来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,es que, después de 30 años de fundación,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.12,0:19:16.54,中文,,0,0,0,,从未有人想过兴建教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.12,0:19:16.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,no se les haya ocurrido construir una iglesia.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.62,0:19:21.58,中文,,0,0,0,,事实上 我们从来都不需要教堂来和上帝讨价还价 尼卡诺先生
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.62,0:19:19.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es que nunca hemos necesitado una iglesia
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.83,0:19:21.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para negociar con Dios, don Nicanor.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.75,0:19:26.46,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝从不与人讨价还价 女士《圣经》上清楚地阐述了这一点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.75,0:19:24.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Es que con Dios no se puede negociar, mi señora.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:26.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Está claro en las Escrituras.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.92,0:19:31.79,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉女士 你可曾想过多年前那场可怕的疫症
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:28.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Apolinar] Señora Úrsula,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:32.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿no se le ha ocurrido pensar que la peste esa tan tremenda de hace años
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.54,中文,,0,0,0,,也许是上天对罪孽生活的惩罚？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.21,0:19:34.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,fue un castigo divino por vivir en el pecado?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你想让乌苏拉为整个马孔多代言吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y acaso Úrsula va a tener que responder por todo Macondo?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.92,中文,,0,0,0,,不 我并无此意 绝对没有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:41.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] No, no. De ninguna manera. ¿Cómo va a hacer eso? No.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.42,中文,,0,0,0,,昨晚我梦到了一座神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:44.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Anoche estaba soñando justamente con el templo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Mmm? - [asiente]
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.71,中文,,0,0,0,,那是举国上下最大的殿宇
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:47.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Era el templo más grande del país,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.08,中文,,0,0,0,,里面有从地面延伸至天花板的彩绘玻璃窗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:50.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,con vitrales del piso al techo,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.88,中文,,0,0,0,,等身大小的圣者雕像
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.08,0:19:52.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,santos de tamaño humano
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.79,中文,,0,0,0,,还有一架管风琴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y con un órgano.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.54,中文,,0,0,0,,与巴黎圣母院的管风琴如出一辙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.33,0:19:57.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Un órgano como el de Notre Dame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:19:58.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ah…
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.92,0:20:01.29,中文,,0,0,0,,我们已经捐款了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:01.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nosotros ya hicimos nuestro aporte, ¿no?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.96,0:20:04.42,中文,,0,0,0,,希望其他镇民也能出一份力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:04.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Esperamos que el resto del pueblo se una.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.46,中文,,0,0,0,,在上帝的祝福和大家的帮助下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:09.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Con la gracia de Dios y la colaboración de todos,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.96,0:20:12.79,中文,,0,0,0,,也许我们三年内就能完工
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.96,0:20:12.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,es posible que en tres años estemos abriendo las puertas.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.46,中文,,0,0,0,,丽贝卡可真是个幸运儿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entonces, Rebeca será la más afortunada.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.92,中文,,0,0,0,,能成为第一个在新教堂举行婚礼的人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tendrás la dicha de inaugurar la iglesia con tu boda.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.00,0:20:20.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [golpea la mesa] - ¡No!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.17,0:20:20.08,中文,,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.17,中文,,0,0,0,,原谅我 神父
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.88,0:20:24.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No me malentienda, padre.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.67,中文,,0,0,0,,能在新教堂结婚是我的荣幸
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:26.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Sería un honor casarnos en la iglesia,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.54,中文,,0,0,0,,但我认为没理由等那么久
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.62,0:20:29.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,pero no veo por qué tendríamos que esperar tanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.92,0:20:32.17,中文,,0,0,0,,理由就是你们的结合会得到神的祝福
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.92,0:20:32.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Porque su relación estaría bendecida por Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.29,中文,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Estaría bendecida.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.96,中文,,0,0,0,,-雷梅黛丝他们就没得到吗？-丽贝卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:35.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿La de Remedios y Aureliano no lo está? - Rebeca.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.04,0:20:37.83,中文,,0,0,0,,为什么非得等三年？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.04,0:20:37.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿A cuenta de qué debemos esperar tres años?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.25,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺就在这里结的婚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.92,0:20:39.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si Aureliano se casó aquí.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:39.33,0:20:42.38,中文,,0,0,0,,因为这个家里的人一夜之间全成了保守派
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.33,0:20:42.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,A cuenta de que todos se volvieron godos de la noche a la mañana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:43.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[exclamaciones]
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.83,0:20:48.25,中文,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:48.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué fue lo que dijiste?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.04,0:20:53.46,中文,,0,0,0,,-我说这个家里…-给我闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.04,0:20:51.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Que todos se volvieron godos de…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.75,0:20:53.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [golpea la mesa] - ¡Te callas ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.17,0:21:00.00,中文,,0,0,0,,我们共同建立了这里的一切尼卡诺先生
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:21:00.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,En este pueblo todo se ha construido entre todos, Nicanor.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.33,0:21:05.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我相信那座教堂会很快落成
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.33,0:21:05.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y la iglesia va a estar lista mucho antes de lo que usted se imagina.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.12,0:21:10.38,中文,,0,0,0,,而我们也会有足够的时间筹备你应得的婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:10.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Y nosotros vamos a tener todo el tiempo para organizar la boda que te mereces.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.17,0:21:27.83,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.17,0:21:27.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Remedios tenía razón.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你是个有学识的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Usted es un hombre culto.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.42,中文,,0,0,0,,谁教你这么进别人房间的？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y a usted quién le enseñó a entrar así, no?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:34.83,0:21:35.96,中文,,0,0,0,,这么不请自来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.83,0:21:35.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Sin ser invitado.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.04,0:21:37.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Los Moscote somos curiosos.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.21,0:21:37.71,中文,,0,0,0,,摩斯科特家的人都很好奇
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.00,中文,,0,0,0,,你想怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué quiere?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.71,0:21:44.67,中文,,0,0,0,,阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:47.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, logré que el gobierno me diera los recursos
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.29,0:21:48.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我向政府争取到了在马孔多兴办学校的资源
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:48.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para abrir una escuela en Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.71,0:21:51.38,中文,,0,0,0,,但尚未找到
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.71,0:21:52.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero no encuentro al maestro que quiera quedarse ahí
Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.46,0:21:55.00,中文,,0,0,0,,愿意留在这里全职照看学校的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:55.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para cuidar las instalaciones de tiempo completo.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:55.96,0:21:59.42,中文,,0,0,0,,听着 我不想找工作也没兴趣给任何人打工
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:59.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Vea, a mí no me interesa trabajarle ni rendirle cuentas a nadie.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.00,0:22:03.67,中文,,0,0,0,,我还有很多事要忙可没工夫插手学校的事物
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:03.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tengo demasiadas cosas en la mesa como para andar metiendo mis narices ahí.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.75,0:22:05.62,中文,,0,0,0,,你意下如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:05.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué dice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:11.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[chirrido de insectos]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.12,0:22:49.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[traqueteo]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.33,0:22:52.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 10,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.50,中文,,0,0,0,,我还在等你道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.50,0:22:57.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Todavía estoy esperando una disculpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:59.71,0:23:00.88,中文,,0,0,0,,你要去哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.71,0:23:00.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Adónde vas, Arcadio?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.79,0:23:04.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你现在有空余的房间了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.79,0:23:04.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ahí le queda un cuarto libre.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你什么都不用说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.58,0:23:10.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No tiene que decir nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.21,中文,,0,0,0,,我早该离开这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.62,0:23:14.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tuve que haberme ido hace rato.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:20.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.25,中文,,0,0,0,,-不好意思-请你配合 医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [hombre 1] Permiso. - [hombre 2] Colabore.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.46,0:24:04.33,中文,,0,0,0,,我不知道你说的是什么文件
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.46,0:24:06.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Colaboro, pero no sé… - Cualquiera se puede proclamar doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.42,0:24:06.00,中文,,0,0,0,,任何人都可以自称是医生
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.08,0:24:08.08,中文,,0,0,0,,放尊重点 我不知道你究竟想要什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.08,0:24:09.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Me respeta. No sé qué papel quiere. - Los papeles que necesita…
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.17,0:24:10.88,中文,,0,0,0,,-开店所需的文件-我什么也不会给你！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:13.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Yo no les voy a dar ningún papel! En toda la ciénaga, nadie me había pedido
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.96,0:24:12.08,中文,,0,0,0,,在大沼泽地一带
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.58,0:24:16.04,中文,,0,0,0,,从来没有人问我要过什么政府签发的经营许可
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.50,0:24:16.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,un permiso del gobierno para ejercer mi oficio.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.12,0:24:22.12,中文,,0,0,0,,除非你们带一本民法典过来指出哪条相关法律规定了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:19.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Así que a menos que ustedes vengan aquí con el Código Civil
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.75,0:24:21.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y me señalen una ley
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.00,0:24:25.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que me obligue a mostrarles algo diferente a los diplomas que me certifican,
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.21,0:24:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我必须给你们出示除却这份文凭以外的东西
Dialogue: 10,0:24:25.83,0:24:27.96,中文,,0,0,0,,否则就请好走不送
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.83,0:24:27.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,les voy a pedir que se vayan de acá.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:28.58,0:24:31.42,中文,,0,0,0,,离开我的店 客人都被你们吓跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.58,0:24:31.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aléjense de mi negocio, que me están espantando a la clientela.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:33.04,0:24:34.29,中文,,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:34.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Disculpe la molestia.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:41.54,0:24:43.79,中文,,0,0,0,,已经有段时间没人敢反抗他们了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.54,0:24:43.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Desde hace tiempo nadie se les enfrentaba así.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:44.38,0:24:48.29,中文,,0,0,0,,看来需要有人提醒一下镇民们他们是有个人权利的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.38,0:24:48.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Bueno, seguramente que les hace falta alguien que les recuerde sus derechos.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:50.33,0:24:53.62,中文,,0,0,0,,我是艾利洛·诺盖拉医生主张顺势疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.33,0:24:52.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Doctor Alirio Noguera.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.88,0:24:53.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Homeópata.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:54.29,0:24:56.12,中文,,0,0,0,,-幸会-我叫阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:56.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Mucho gusto. - Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:57.00,0:24:58.25,中文,,0,0,0,,是一名校长
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.00,0:24:58.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Director de la escuela.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:00.54,0:25:01.54,中文,,0,0,0,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.54,0:25:01.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Joder!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.75,0:25:05.46,中文,,0,0,0,,要照看那么多孩子 责任可不小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.75,0:25:05.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tremenda responsabilidad la que tiene con esos pelados.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:08.38,0:25:10.00,中文,,0,0,0,,如果想找人聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.38,0:25:10.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Cuando usted quiera hablar
Dialogue: 10,0:25:10.08,0:25:11.88,中文,,0,0,0,,或者需要吃药的话
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.08,0:25:12.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,o cuando necesite un medicamento,
Dialogue: 10,0:25:12.25,0:25:13.96,中文,,0,0,0,,欢迎随时来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.25,0:25:13.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,ya sabe dónde encontrarme.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.12,0:25:16.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música inquietante]
Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.92,0:25:18.75,中文,,0,0,0,,（公立学校）
Dialogue: 10,0:25:47.42,0:25:49.25,中文,,0,0,0,,哪怕只是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.42,0:25:49.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.21,0:25:54.21,中文,,0,0,0,,这所学校终于让阿卡蒂奥从那压抑苦闷的家庭中解放了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.21,0:25:54.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,la escuela borró en Arcadio el peso de esa vieja amargura familiar.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:56.79,0:25:58.04,中文,,0,0,0,,炼金术…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.79,0:25:58.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La alquimia…
Dialogue: 10,0:25:59.83,0:26:05.62,中文,,0,0,0,,炼金术为人类历史上最杰出的众多圣贤所痴迷
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.83,0:26:01.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La alquimia
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.04,0:26:04.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,ha obsesionado a los hombres
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.25,0:26:05.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,más geniales de la historia,
Dialogue: 10,0:26:06.88,0:26:10.83,中文,,0,0,0,,因为他们穷极一生都在探寻着传说中的贤者之石
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.88,0:26:10.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,con el fin de encontrar la famosa piedra filosofal.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:11.33,0:26:13.92,中文,,0,0,0,,贤者之石…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:13.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,"La piedra filosofal".
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.12,0:26:19.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio ríe] Me imagino que, por su voz, no tiene ni idea de qué es eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:16.54,0:26:19.50,中文,,0,0,0,,听你这语气 大概不知道那是什么吧
Dialogue: 10,0:26:20.58,0:26:22.83,中文,,0,0,0,,老师 冈萨雷斯本来就什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.58,0:26:24.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Profe, es que González nunca sabe nada. Nunca sabe nada.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:23.33,0:26:24.54,中文,,0,0,0,,他从来都一问三不知
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.46,0:26:25.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[risas]
Dialogue: 10,0:26:25.88,0:26:28.50,中文,,0,0,0,,那就请你来黑板前为大家讲解一番吧 罗哈斯
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.88,0:26:28.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entonces, venga. Pase y explique el tablero, Rojas.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.50,中文,,0,0,0,,不 其实我也很无知
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.58,0:26:30.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Rojas] No, pero yo tampoco, tampoco.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.25,0:26:32.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[agua cae]
Dialogue: 10,0:26:33.88,0:26:37.21,中文,,0,0,0,,最重要的是别迷失了自己的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.88,0:26:37.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B. en latín] Es necesario no perder el rumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.29,0:26:41.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula en español] No más, José Arcadio. Si vas a hablar, dime algo que me sirva.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.62,0:26:38.79,中文,,0,0,0,,别说了 何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 10,0:26:39.62,0:26:41.58,中文,,0,0,0,,非要说的话 说点我能听懂的
Dialogue: 10,0:26:47.38,0:26:48.38,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.38,0:26:48.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias, mija.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.21,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:51.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] Te lo agradezco.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.12,0:26:54.08,中文,,0,0,0,,来擦擦
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:54.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] A ver…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.96,0:27:00.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios jadea]
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.79,0:27:02.67,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.79,0:27:02.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué te pasa?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:14.46,0:27:15.29,中文,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.46,0:27:15.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué tiene?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.88,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.08,0:27:21.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aureliano… [ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:27:23.04,0:27:25.12,中文,,0,0,0,,你们结婚已经好几个月了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.04,0:27:25.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ya llevan varios meses casados.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.71,中文,,0,0,0,,你觉得会是什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.38,0:27:27.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué crees que va a tener?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:35.12,0:27:37.46,中文,,0,0,0,,奥雷里亚诺·何塞要有兄弟姐妹了？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:37.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Le vamos a dar un hermano a Aureliano José?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.58,0:27:44.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[vomita]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.04,0:27:52.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave alegre]
Dialogue: 10,0:27:54.46,0:27:56.08,中文,,0,0,0,,你们能一起织一个白色的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.46,0:27:56.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y si juntas hacen una blanca?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:56.83,0:27:58.83,中文,,0,0,0,,虽然还不知道是男是女
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.83,0:27:58.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No sabemos si va a ser niño o niña, pero…
Dialogue: 10,0:27:59.00,0:28:01.67,中文,,0,0,0,,但如果孩子收到的第一份礼物是姑姑们一起做的该多好
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.00,0:28:01.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sería lindo que lo primero que tenga lo hayan hecho sus tías.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:05.21,0:28:09.46,中文,,0,0,0,,这对夫妇唤起了两个家庭内部的深厚情谊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] que la pareja
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.54,0:28:09.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,despertó en la familia de ambos,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:10.46,0:28:13.29,中文,,0,0,0,,以至于当蕾梅黛丝宣布怀孕的消息时
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.46,0:28:13.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que cuando Remedios anunció que iba a tener un hijo,
Dialogue: 10,0:28:13.88,0:28:16.58,中文,,0,0,0,,连丽贝卡和阿玛兰妲都休战了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.88,0:28:16.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,hasta Rebeca y Amaranta hicieron una tregua.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:18.71,0:28:22.71,中文,,0,0,0,,可你答应过我的 先生！这可是上帝的神殿呀
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.71,0:28:22.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] ¡Me hizo una promesa, hombre! Estamos hablando de la casa del Señor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.79,0:28:26.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hombre, padre, si el Señor hubiera abonado lo que nos debe, ya hubiéramos terminado.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:22.96,0:28:26.96,中文,,0,0,0,,神父 如果上帝付了我们应得的钱到这会儿我们已经完工了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.04,0:28:30.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo quiere que cobre el diezmo para pagarle si no me deja inaugurar?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:27.12,0:28:30.21,中文,,0,0,0,,教堂不能开门迎客我上哪要什一税来付你们钱呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.29,0:28:33.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Con el diezmo le voy a pagar. - ¿Con el qué? ¿Pagará con el diezmo?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:30.46,0:28:33.58,中文,,0,0,0,,-收到什一税我就有钱给你们了-什么玩意？什一税？
Dialogue: 10,0:28:33.71,0:28:35.83,中文,,0,0,0,,对 没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.71,0:28:35.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [Nicanor] Con… con… el diezmo… - Padre…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.79,0:28:39.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- No se preocupe, padre. - ¿Cuánto lleva así?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:37.79,0:28:40.33,中文,,0,0,0,,-这种状况持续多久了？-一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.50,0:28:40.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Un mes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.42,0:28:42.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Parece que se les acabó la plata.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:41.00,0:28:42.54,中文,,0,0,0,,看来他们没钱了
Dialogue: 10,0:28:43.62,0:28:45.75,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝不会用棍棒或鞭子惩戒世人
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.62,0:28:45.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dios castiga sin palo y sin perrero.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:46.00,0:28:47.88,中文,,0,0,0,,铺瓦片吧 慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:47.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[obrero] Vamos a poner las tejas.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:47.96,0:28:50.46,中文,,0,0,0,,我可不想被砸到
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:50.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Por lo menos que no me caiga algo encima.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:54.42,0:28:55.54,中文,,0,0,0,,我们私奔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.42,0:28:55.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Escapémonos.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:55.62,0:28:57.00,中文,,0,0,0,,去哪里呢 丽贝卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.62,0:28:57.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca, ¿adónde?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:58.08,0:28:59.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我所拥有的一切都在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.08,0:28:59.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Si todo lo que tengo está aquí.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.96,0:29:05.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.83,0:29:07.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-怎么了？-没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.12,0:29:19.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué pasó?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:21.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nada. Todo bien, señora Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:20.33,0:29:21.75,中文,,0,0,0,,一切都好 乌苏拉女士
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:27.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música cesa]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.75,0:29:28.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.96,0:29:38.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[temblor]
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.83,0:29:50.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[mujer gime]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.62,0:30:02.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gemidos continúan]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.96,0:30:15.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gime y grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.21,0:30:32.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B. ríe a carcajadas]
Dialogue: 10,0:31:29.54,0:31:35.62,中文,,0,0,0,,求主怜悯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.54,0:31:35.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] ♪
Dialogue: 10,0:31:39.33,0:31:42.25,中文,,0,0,0,,没有募集到安装大门的捐款
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.33,0:31:42.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] ni lo de las puertas,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:43.04,0:31:46.04,中文,,0,0,0,,尼卡诺摇晃着小铃铛走遍全镇
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.04,0:31:46.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Nicanor recorrió el pueblo con una campanita,
Dialogue: 10,0:31:46.79,0:31:48.67,中文,,0,0,0,,召集人们参加露天弥撒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.79,0:31:48.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,convocando a la misa campal.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:48.92,0:31:51.21,中文,,0,0,0,,求主怜悯…
Dialogue: 10,0:31:51.29,0:31:53.21,中文,,0,0,0,,很多人出于好奇前去观看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.29,0:31:53.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Muchos fueron por curiosidad.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:54.00,0:31:55.62,中文,,0,0,0,,还有些是出于怀旧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.00,0:31:55.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Otros, por nostalgia.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:57.54,0:31:59.38,中文,,0,0,0,,其余人则是为防万一
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.54,0:32:00.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Otros, para que Dios no fuera a tomar como agravio personal
Dialogue: 10,0:31:59.46,0:32:03.50,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝将他们对其代言人的无视视为渎神之举
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.54,0:32:03.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,el desprecio a su intermediario.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.58,0:32:06.08,中文,,0,0,0,,现在诸位将见证
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.58,0:32:06.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Ahora van a ser testigos
Dialogue: 10,0:32:07.29,0:32:11.46,中文,,0,0,0,,彰显上帝威能的无可辩驳的证据！
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.29,0:32:11.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de la prueba irrebatible del poder de Dios!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:13.08,0:32:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,那个给他充当助手的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:15.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] que había estado ayudándole
Dialogue: 10,0:32:16.25,0:32:20.38,中文,,0,0,0,,端上来一杯浓稠的巧克力他将其一饮而尽
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.25,0:32:20.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,le llevó una taza de chocolate espeso que él se tomó sin respirar.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:43.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[exclamaciones]
Dialogue: 10,0:32:43.29,0:32:45.00,中文,,0,0,0,,这是真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.29,0:32:44.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[mujer] ¿Es real?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.25,0:32:46.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.46,0:32:53.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música celestial]
Dialogue: 10,0:33:08.54,0:33:12.17,中文,,0,0,0,,所有人都被他展现的神迹所折服…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.54,0:33:12.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] el origen divino de la demostración…
Dialogue: 10,0:33:14.71,0:33:16.75,中文,,0,0,0,,除了何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.71,0:33:16.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,salvo José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:18.79,0:33:20.88,中文,,0,0,0,,其实很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.79,0:33:20.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] Es muy simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:22.67,0:33:26.33,中文,,0,0,0,,他发现了物质的第四种状态
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.67,0:33:26.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo que se encontró es el cuarto estado de la materia.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:29.67,0:33:30.54,中文,,0,0,0,,并非如此
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.67,0:33:30.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Lo niego.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:31.96,0:33:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,毫无疑问 这证明了上帝的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.96,0:33:35.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,El hecho prueba sin duda la existencia de Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:38.25,0:33:42.42,中文,,0,0,0,,你的戏法骗不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.25,0:33:42.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,A mí no me engaña con sus trucos de magia.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:44.46,0:33:47.29,中文,,0,0,0,,除非让我看见上帝的银版照片
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.46,0:33:47.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hasta no ver un daguerrotipo de Dios,
Dialogue: 10,0:33:48.04,0:33:51.04,中文,,0,0,0,,否则我绝不会相信你的把戏
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.04,0:33:51.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,no voy a creer en sus artificios.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:54.75,0:33:55.92,中文,,0,0,0,,他说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.75,0:33:55.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] ¿Qué dijo?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.58,0:33:59.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.58,0:33:59.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué está diciendo?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:00.71,0:34:04.17,中文,,0,0,0,,他说他一直想看上帝的银版照片
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.71,0:34:04.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Dice que él siempre quiso ver un daguerrotipo de Dios.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.12,0:34:09.79,中文,,0,0,0,,就这样 他们发现何塞·阿卡蒂奥·布恩迪亚
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.12,0:34:09.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] como se supo que era latín
Dialogue: 10,0:34:10.54,0:34:13.21,中文,,0,0,0,,一直以来那些晦涩难懂的语句是拉丁语
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.54,0:34:13.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,la endiablada jerga de José Arcadio Buendía.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.29,0:34:15.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Doña Úrsula, ¿me permite una palabrita?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:13.38,0:34:15.75,中文,,0,0,0,,-乌苏拉女士 能借一步说话吗？-过来
Dialogue: 10,0:34:17.46,0:34:19.83,中文,,0,0,0,,你得好好休息 这很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.46,0:34:19.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano] Es importante que vayas a descansar.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:20.33,0:34:22.38,中文,,0,0,0,,我有几句话想跟您说
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.33,0:34:22.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es que yo quería hacerle un comentario.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:23.67,0:34:26.50,中文,,0,0,0,,如您所见 我已经竭尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.67,0:34:26.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Usted ve… ha visto, que yo he hecho hasta lo imposible
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.58,0:34:28.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,por atraer a los macondinos a la fe.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:26.75,0:34:28.46,中文,,0,0,0,,给马孔多的人民传播信仰了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.54,0:34:29.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ajá.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:30.54,0:34:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,但若募集到的捐款一直如此微薄根本不可能在三年内建成教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.54,0:34:32.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero al paso que vamos con las donaciones,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.75,0:34:35.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,yo no voy a terminar esa iglesia en tres años.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:35.58,0:34:37.46,中文,,0,0,0,,甚至可能要花上十年
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.58,0:34:37.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,A lo mucho, la terminaré en diez.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:38.96,0:34:41.62,中文,,0,0,0,,所以我想恳请您帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.96,0:34:41.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Entonces, quería preguntarle si usted pudiera ayudarme
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:43.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,de repente hablando con la gente…
Dialogue: 10,0:34:41.83,0:34:43.38,中文,,0,0,0,,劝劝镇民们…
Dialogue: 10,0:34:43.46,0:34:46.58,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不该要求乌苏拉女士背负如此重任 神父
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.46,0:34:46.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No le pongamos esa responsabilidad a doña Úrsula, padre.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.50,中文,,0,0,0,,上帝知晓凡事皆有定数
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dios sabe que las cosas pasan cuando tienen que pasar.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.58,0:34:53.17,中文,,0,0,0,,-阿门-再说了 我们有什么好心急的呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.58,0:34:50.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Amén.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.92,0:34:53.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Amén. - Igual, ¿cuál es el afán?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:54.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.75,0:35:03.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula suspira]
Dialogue: 10,0:35:06.04,0:35:07.29,中文,,0,0,0,,回头见 女士
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.04,0:35:07.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hasta luego, mi señora.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:07.96,0:35:09.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你快把这群孩子带疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:09.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Tienes a los muchachos trastornados,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.75,0:35:12.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,ahora quieren que les compre libros de química.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:10.21,0:35:12.33,中文,,0,0,0,,这会儿闹着要我给他们买化学书呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.42,0:35:13.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio] ¿Sí?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:12.50,0:35:13.33,中文,,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.42,0:35:16.21,中文,,0,0,0,,是啊 恭喜你找到了合适的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.42,0:35:14.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] Sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.79,0:35:16.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Felicitaciones por el puesto.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:16.33,0:35:18.00,中文,,0,0,0,,-谢谢-走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.33,0:35:18.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Gracias. - Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.38,0:35:22.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música alegre]
Dialogue: 10,0:35:32.46,0:35:35.00,中文,,0,0,0,,对自己身世一无所知的阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.46,0:35:35.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] el secreto de su filiación,
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.71,0:35:39.50,中文,,0,0,0,,开始迷恋上皮拉·特内拉正如他父亲当年一样
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.71,0:35:39.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pilar Ternera se convirtió en una obsesión como lo fue para su padre.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:50.50,0:35:51.88,中文,,0,0,0,,他会四处找寻她的身影…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.50,0:35:51.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Él la buscaba…
Dialogue: 10,0:35:53.12,0:35:56.29,中文,,0,0,0,,待到循着她身上的烟味找见了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.12,0:35:56.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y la encontraba en el rastro de su olor a humo,
Dialogue: 10,0:35:57.21,0:36:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,又不知该如何接近她
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.21,0:36:00.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sin saber exactamente cómo acercarse.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:04.96,0:36:05.83,中文,,0,0,0,,再来一杯？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.96,0:36:05.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Otra?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:12.12,0:36:13.00,中文,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.12,0:36:13.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Gracias.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:14.67,0:36:15.50,中文,,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:15.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Mira.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:18.50,0:36:19.50,中文,,0,0,0,,马蒂尔德！
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.50,0:36:19.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula] ¡Matilde!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:26.62,0:36:28.54,中文,,0,0,0,,我们不再是朋友了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:28.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Es que ya no somos amigos o qué?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:28.62,0:36:30.17,中文,,0,0,0,,我也正纳闷儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.62,0:36:30.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso me pregunto yo.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:31.12,0:36:33.29,中文,,0,0,0,,你好久没来我们家坐坐了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:33.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hace tiempo que no pasas por la casa.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:34.75,0:36:37.83,中文,,0,0,0,,自从何塞·阿卡蒂奥出事以后我每天忙得脚不沾地
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.75,0:36:38.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La verdad es que no me queda ni un minuto desde lo de José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:38.29,0:36:39.38,中文,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.29,0:36:39.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me imagino.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:39.96,0:36:41.42,中文,,0,0,0,,我们都很想念他
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.96,0:36:41.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hace falta el compadre.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:43.96,0:36:46.75,中文,,0,0,0,,难以置信的是那天他居然开始跟尼卡诺交谈了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.96,0:36:46.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Imagínate que el otro día se puso a hablar con Nicanor.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:47.54,0:36:50.75,中文,,0,0,0,,托了那神父的福我们才能听明白他在说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.54,0:36:50.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,De no ser por él, no nos hubiéramos dado cuenta de lo que dice.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:52.71,0:36:54.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他们俩现在能聊上一整天
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.71,0:36:56.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Se la pasa todo el día conversando, como lo hacía contigo.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:55.21,0:36:56.46,中文,,0,0,0,,就像你们俩当年一样
Dialogue: 10,0:36:59.12,0:37:00.54,中文,,0,0,0,,尼卡诺是个好人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.12,0:37:00.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es un buen hombre, Nicanor.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:01.04,0:37:02.79,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉 你到底想说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.04,0:37:02.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué nos estás diciendo, Úrsula?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:05.08,0:37:07.12,中文,,0,0,0,,有时候我感觉跟摩斯科特家的姻亲关系
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.08,0:37:07.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Creo que esa cercanía con los Moscote
Dialogue: 10,0:37:07.21,0:37:09.96,中文,,0,0,0,,让你忘了这个小镇是我们跟何塞·阿卡蒂奥共同创建的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.21,0:37:09.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,te hizo olvidar el pueblo que fundamos con José Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:15.92,0:37:18.50,中文,,0,0,0,,很不凑巧何塞·阿卡蒂奥如今被绑在树上
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.92,0:37:18.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Resulta que José Arcadio está amarrado a un árbol.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.75,中文,,0,0,0,,我成了家里的顶梁柱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.83,0:37:21.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ahora yo tengo que ver por la familia.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:23.92,0:37:25.92,中文,,0,0,0,,我的记性很好 盖里奈多
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.92,0:37:25.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,La memoria no me falla, Gerineldo.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:27.00,0:37:30.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我记得你们两个在奥雷里亚诺的婚礼上中途离席
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.00,0:37:30.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Así como sé que ustedes se fueron en la mitad del matrimonio de Aureliano,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:31.29,0:37:33.33,中文,,0,0,0,,我也记得在何塞·阿卡蒂奥疯魔以后
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.29,0:37:33.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,también sé que los Moscote
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.42,0:37:37.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,han sido los únicos que han pisado la casa desde que José Arcadio me dejó sola.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:33.50,0:37:37.12,中文,,0,0,0,,在我孤单无助时来探望过的就只有摩斯科特一家人
Dialogue: 10,0:37:38.38,0:37:39.58,中文,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你们两位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.38,0:37:39.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Me dio gusto verlos.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:42.12,0:37:42.96,中文,,0,0,0,,失陪了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.12,0:37:42.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Permiso.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:53.62,0:37:55.38,中文,,0,0,0,,我一直无法理解…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.62,0:37:55.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en latín] Nunca he entendido…
Dialogue: 10,0:37:57.33,0:38:00.17,中文,,0,0,0,,两个原则相同的派别斗得不可开交
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.33,0:38:00.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,el sentido de una contienda entre dos adversarios
Dialogue: 10,0:38:00.79,0:38:03.12,中文,,0,0,0,,究竟有何意义
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.79,0:38:03.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que comparten los mismos principios.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.75,0:38:04.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Mmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:12.67,0:38:14.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他们怎么能…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.67,0:38:14.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo es posible que lo tengan…
Dialogue: 10,0:38:16.12,0:38:17.25,中文,,0,0,0,,把你捆在树上？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.12,0:38:17.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,amarrado a un árbol?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:19.75,0:38:21.25,中文,,0,0,0,,很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.75,0:38:21.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Es muy simple.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:24.00,0:38:25.58,中文,,0,0,0,,因为我疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.00,0:38:25.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] Porque estoy loco.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:33.38,0:38:35.33,中文,,0,0,0,,害怕信仰被动摇的神父
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.38,0:38:35.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.08,中文,,0,0,0,,没有再回来探望过他
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.00,0:38:38.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,el cura no volvió a visitarlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.62,0:38:55.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula suspira]
Dialogue: 10,0:38:56.12,0:38:58.17,中文,,0,0,0,,至少吃一勺吧 孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.12,0:38:58.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Al menos una cucharada, muchacha.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:58.67,0:39:00.75,中文,,0,0,0,,你不能饿着肚子里的宝宝呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.67,0:39:00.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No puedes dejar a esa criatura sin comer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.54,0:39:02.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.46,0:39:12.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[temblor]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.17,0:39:18.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Rebeca gime]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.79,0:39:23.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gemidos continúan]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.67,0:39:36.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gemidos cesan]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.67,0:39:40.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[José Arcadio B. ríe a carcajadas]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.75,0:39:52.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave alegre]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.04,0:40:21.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música cesa]
Dialogue: 10,0:40:21.21,0:40:22.38,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉女士
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.21,0:40:22.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Doña Úrsula.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:23.04,0:40:25.62,中文,,0,0,0,,无论有没有彩绘玻璃和教堂大钟
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.04,0:40:25.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Con o sin vitrales, con o sin campanas,
Dialogue: 10,0:40:25.71,0:40:28.96,中文,,0,0,0,,这个月底必须让丽贝卡举行婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.71,0:40:28.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Rebeca tiene que estar parada en el altar antes de que el mes termine.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:30.54,0:40:32.00,中文,,0,0,0,,明白了吗 尼卡诺？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.54,0:40:32.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Estamos claros, Nicanor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.08,0:40:37.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música suave alegre]
Dialogue: 10,0:40:50.42,0:40:53.08,中文,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.42,0:40:51.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en italiano] Amor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.21,0:40:53.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Buenos días.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:54.12,0:40:55.50,中文,,0,0,0,,写信给你妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:55.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[en español] Escríbele a tu mamá.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:55.88,0:40:59.46,中文,,0,0,0,,不管她来不来我们一个月后就要在马孔多完婚了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.88,0:40:59.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,En un mes nos casamos, esté ella o no en Macondo.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:11.46,0:41:15.92,中文,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲惴惴不安地等待着那个时刻浑身因恐惧而颤抖
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.46,0:41:15.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] de pavor esperando aquella hora.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.50,0:41:20.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música alegre continúa]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.67,0:41:49.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de aves]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.50,0:41:53.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Ay… Ay, se cae.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:52.29,0:41:54.96,中文,,0,0,0,,站稳 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.00,0:41:54.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Eso.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.33,0:42:11.54,中文,,0,0,0,,你觉得会是男孩还是女孩？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.33,0:42:11.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios] ¿Qué crees? ¿Va a ser niño o niña?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:12.08,0:42:15.62,中文,,0,0,0,,不知道 但不是一个 而是两个宝宝
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.08,0:42:13.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano] No sé.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.04,0:42:15.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero no va a ser uno, sino dos.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:16.71,0:42:17.96,中文,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.71,0:42:17.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Y tú cómo sabes eso?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:19.67,0:42:23.04,中文,,0,0,0,,就跟我在丽贝卡满眼惊恐地走进那扇门之前
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.67,0:42:22.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,De la misma forma que supe que Rebeca llegaría
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.08,0:42:24.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,antes de que cruzara esa puerta con ojos de espanto.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:23.12,0:42:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,就预感到了她会来一样
Dialogue: 10,0:42:25.71,0:42:28.50,中文,,0,0,0,,不相信吗？去问我妈妈吧 她会告诉你的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.71,0:42:28.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿No me crees? Pregúntale a mamá, para que veas.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:34.21,0:42:35.29,中文,,0,0,0,,米格！
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.21,0:42:35.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar] ¡Migue!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:36.71,0:42:37.67,中文,,0,0,0,,你跑哪儿去了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.71,0:42:37.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Dónde estabas?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:39.12,0:42:40.04,中文,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.12,0:42:41.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué? [ríe]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.79,0:42:44.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[bullicio]
Dialogue: 10,0:42:53.33,0:42:54.71,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.33,0:42:55.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Vale, qué es lo que tienes ahí? ¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:56.46,0:42:57.50,中文,,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.46,0:42:58.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Qué fue lo que te pasó? ¿Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:58.29,0:43:00.04,中文,,0,0,0,,-好痒-痒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.29,0:43:00.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [Miguel] Pica. - [Pilar] ¿Te pica?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:04.50,0:43:05.50,中文,,0,0,0,,你好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:05.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Cómo estás?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.75,0:43:15.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[bullicio continúa]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.17,0:43:19.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Pilar ríe]
Dialogue: 10,0:43:21.29,0:43:22.17,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.29,0:43:22.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Arcadio] ¡Pilar!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:23.04,0:43:23.88,中文,,0,0,0,,校长
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.04,0:43:23.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Director.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:24.38,0:43:25.79,中文,,0,0,0,,我们能谈谈吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.38,0:43:26.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Podría hablar con usted un segundo?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:26.29,0:43:28.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-我儿子惹麻烦了吗？-不 当然不是
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.29,0:43:28.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Hizo algo mi muchacho? - No. Claro que no.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:29.25,0:43:30.50,中文,,0,0,0,,-麻烦照看一下他-没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.25,0:43:30.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Lo cuida un momento? - Bien.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:31.29,0:43:32.21,中文,,0,0,0,,什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.29,0:43:32.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dígame.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.46,0:43:34.29,中文,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.46,0:43:34.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Siga.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.83,0:43:42.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[cierra con llave]
Dialogue: 10,0:43:44.75,0:43:47.42,中文,,0,0,0,,不！
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.75,0:43:46.25,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡No! ¡No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.33,0:43:47.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Arcadio! ¡No!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:47.50,0:43:49.29,中文,,0,0,0,,-不 阿卡蒂奥 不要！-不要？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.50,0:43:50.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¡No! ¡Arcadio, no, no! - ¿No? ¿No?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:49.38,0:43:50.71,中文,,0,0,0,,-不要！-不要？
Dialogue: 10,0:43:51.62,0:43:52.96,中文,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.62,0:43:52.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.71,0:43:55.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Arcadio, no.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:55.46,0:43:58.71,中文,,0,0,0,,别装出一副圣洁的模样大家都知道你是个娼妇
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.46,0:43:59.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te vas a hacer la santa. Todo el mundo sabe que eres una puta, ¿ah?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:02.96,0:44:04.54,中文,,0,0,0,,不要在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.96,0:44:05.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- Aquí no. Aquí no. - [jadea]
Dialogue: 10,0:44:05.67,0:44:07.75,中文,,0,0,0,,换个地方 换个时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.67,0:44:07.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Aquí no. ¡Ahora no!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:08.29,0:44:10.71,中文,,0,0,0,,我儿子在外面 他会听见的 阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.29,0:44:10.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Afuera está mi hijo y puede escucharnos, Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:10.79,0:44:12.62,中文,,0,0,0,,阿卡蒂奥！
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.79,0:44:12.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Arcadio! Arcadio.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:17.17,0:44:18.12,中文,,0,0,0,,我会去找你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.17,0:44:18.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo vengo.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:19.50,0:44:21.00,中文,,0,0,0,,今晚就去
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.50,0:44:21.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Yo vengo esta noche.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:21.54,0:44:24.67,中文,,0,0,0,,给我留着门 关上灯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.54,0:44:24.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Deja la puerta abierta y la luz apagada.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:27.12,0:44:28.08,中文,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.12,0:44:28.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- ¿Sí? - ¿Segura?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:30.08,0:44:32.08,中文,,0,0,0,,我骗你干什么 阿卡蒂奥？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.08,0:44:32.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Por qué habría de mentirte, Arcadio?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.67,0:44:34.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¿Mmm?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:36.88,0:44:38.17,中文,,0,0,0,,今晚等我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.88,0:44:38.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Espérame esta noche.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:44.50,0:44:45.96,中文,,0,0,0,,米格尔！我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.50,0:44:45.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Miguel! Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.54,0:45:01.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 10,0:45:12.29,0:45:13.92,中文,,0,0,0,,他彻夜未眠地等待着
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.29,0:45:13.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:45:15.08,0:45:18.96,中文,,0,0,0,,在漫长无尽的清晨聆听着蟋蟀发情的鸣叫
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.08,0:45:18.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,oyendo los grillos alborotados de la madrugada sin término,
Dialogue: 10,0:45:20.00,0:45:22.88,中文,,0,0,0,,他越发坚信自己被骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.00,0:45:22.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,cada vez más convencido de que lo había engañado.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.83,0:45:47.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[jadean]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.21,0:46:08.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música dramática]
Dialogue: 10,0:46:21.71,0:46:24.54,中文,,0,0,0,,阿卡蒂奥意识到这不是他苦苦等待的那个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.71,0:46:24.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] que no era la mujer que esperaba
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.62,0:46:25.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque no olía a humo.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:24.75,0:46:25.96,中文,,0,0,0,,因为她的身上没有烟味
Dialogue: 10,0:46:35.38,0:46:36.67,中文,,0,0,0,,她还是个处女
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.38,0:46:36.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Era virgen
Dialogue: 10,0:46:37.50,0:46:40.71,中文,,0,0,0,,她的名字叫桑塔索菲亚·德拉·皮埃达
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.50,0:46:40.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y tenía el nombre de Santa Sofía de la Piedad.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:41.83,0:46:44.92,中文,,0,0,0,,皮拉·特内拉给了她50比索
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.83,0:46:44.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pilar Ternera le había pagado 50 pesos,
Dialogue: 10,0:46:46.00,0:46:48.67,中文,,0,0,0,,用自己一半的积蓄
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.00,0:46:48.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,la mitad de sus ahorros de toda la vida,
Dialogue: 10,0:46:49.71,0:46:52.04,中文,,0,0,0,,让她来做此刻在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.71,0:46:52.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para que hiciera lo que estaba haciendo.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:57.38,0:46:59.71,中文,,0,0,0,,阿卡蒂奥见过她很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.38,0:46:59.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Arcadio la había visto muchas veces
Dialogue: 10,0:47:00.33,0:47:02.50,中文,,0,0,0,,但从未仔细端详过她
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.33,0:47:02.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y nunca se había fijado en ella,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:03.17,0:47:06.54,中文,,0,0,0,,因为她具有一种罕见的品质从来只有稀薄的存在感
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.17,0:47:06.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque tenía la rara virtud de no existir por completo,
Dialogue: 10,0:47:07.17,0:47:09.04,中文,,0,0,0,,除非碰上了适当的时机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.17,0:47:09.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,sino en el momento oportuno.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.08,中文,,0,0,0,,但从那天起
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Pero desde aquel día
Dialogue: 10,0:47:17.83,0:47:20.58,中文,,0,0,0,,他便像只猫一样蜷缩在她温暖的腋下了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.83,0:47:20.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,se enroscó como un gato al calor de su axila.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.00,0:47:34.21,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[reza en voz baja]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.29,0:47:36.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[canto de grillos]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.42,0:47:45.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[gritos]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.71,0:47:49.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grita]
Dialogue: 10,0:47:54.79,0:47:56.38,中文,,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.79,0:47:56.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Ayuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:57.08,0:47:59.58,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅！呼吸！
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.08,0:47:59.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Reme! ¡Reme, respira! ¡Respira!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.58,0:48:03.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [Remedios grita] - [jadea]
Dialogue: 10,0:48:03.17,0:48:04.96,中文,,0,0,0,,快找人帮忙！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.17,0:48:04.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Busquen ayuda!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:06.67,0:48:08.33,中文,,0,0,0,,叫医生来！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.67,0:48:08.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Busquen un médico!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:08.42,0:48:09.58,中文,,0,0,0,,妈妈！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.42,0:48:09.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mamá!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.67,0:48:11.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Remedios grita]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.79,0:48:14.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música sombría]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.62,0:48:19.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano jadea]
Dialogue: 10,0:48:22.38,0:48:25.67,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝！喘口气呀！睁开眼看看我！我在这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.38,0:48:24.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Remedios. ¡Remedios, respira!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.25,0:48:26.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mírame! ¡Mírame, aquí estoy!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:26.08,0:48:28.04,中文,,0,0,0,,我就在这里 亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.08,0:48:28.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Aquí estoy! ¡Mi amor! ¡Mi amor!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:28.58,0:48:30.17,中文,,0,0,0,,亲爱的！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.58,0:48:30.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mi amor! ¡Mi amor!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:31.54,0:48:33.46,中文,,0,0,0,,看着我 别睡！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.54,0:48:33.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[llora] Mírame. No te duermas.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.54,0:48:34.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No te duermas.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:33.67,0:48:35.50,中文,,0,0,0,,别睡过去呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.67,0:48:36.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡No te duermas! ¡Mi amor!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:36.71,0:48:38.12,中文,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别睡！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.71,0:48:39.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,¡Mi niña, no te duermas! ¡No te duermas! [llora]
Dialogue: 10,0:48:38.21,0:48:39.38,中文,,0,0,0,,别睡啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.25,0:48:46.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grita]
Dialogue: 10,0:48:46.67,0:48:51.88,中文,,0,0,0,,蕾梅黛丝浸染在自己的血液里中毒而死
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.67,0:48:47.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.12,0:48:51.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,murió envenenada por su propia sangre,
Dialogue: 10,0:48:52.83,0:48:56.00,中文,,0,0,0,,连同一对双胞胎也横死腹中
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.83,0:48:56.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,con un par de gemelos atravesados en el vientre.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.08,0:49:00.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[grito continúa]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.79,0:49:06.88,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Aureliano llora]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.96,0:49:08.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música triste]
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.04,0:49:11.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[llantos]
Dialogue: 10,0:49:30.75,0:49:32.62,中文,,0,0,0,,今天 这可怕的悲剧…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.75,0:49:32.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Nicanor] Hoy, más que nunca,
Dialogue: 10,0:49:34.58,0:49:37.50,中文,,0,0,0,,将我们所有人聚到一起我比以往任何时候…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.58,0:49:37.50,副字幕,,0,0,0,,dadas las terribles circunstancias que nos reúnen…
Dialogue: 10,0:49:40.33,0:49:41.92,中文,,0,0,0,,都更加感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.33,0:49:41.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,le doy gracias a Dios
Dialogue: 10,0:49:43.62,0:49:45.62,中文,,0,0,0,,他以无限的智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.62,0:49:45.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,por su infinita sabiduría…
Dialogue: 10,0:49:48.38,0:49:51.83,中文,,0,0,0,,及时敞开了天国的门
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.38,0:49:50.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,porque nos ha abierto
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.75,0:49:51.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,justo a tiempo
Dialogue: 10,0:49:53.38,0:49:56.04,中文,,0,0,0,,邀我们入他的神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.38,0:49:56.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,las puertas de su templo, de su casa,
Dialogue: 10,0:49:57.29,0:49:58.96,中文,,0,0,0,,使我们能在此卸下
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.29,0:49:58.96,副字幕,,0,0,0,,para que dejemos acá
Dialogue: 10,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.00,中文,,0,0,0,,这场悲剧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,el dolor
Dialogue: 10,0:50:01.75,0:50:03.46,中文,,0,0,0,,所带来的痛苦和重负
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.75,0:50:03.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y el peso de esta tragedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.29,0:50:09.29,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[murmullo]
Dialogue: 10,0:50:10.12,0:50:14.42,中文,,0,0,0,,阿玛兰妲曾切切祈求发生某种可怕的事情阻碍婚礼
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.12,0:50:12.71,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] con tanto fervor
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.79,0:50:16.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que algo pavoroso ocurriera para no tener que envenenar a Rebeca,
Dialogue: 10,0:50:14.50,0:50:16.62,中文,,0,0,0,,使她不必向丽贝卡下毒
Dialogue: 10,0:50:17.29,0:50:20.42,中文,,0,0,0,,她对蕾梅黛丝的死深感内疚
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.29,0:50:20.42,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que se sintió culpable por la muerte de Remedios,
Dialogue: 10,0:50:21.17,0:50:25.75,中文,,0,0,0,,收养了奥雷里亚诺·何塞这个孩子将陪伴她走过永恒的孤独
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.17,0:50:22.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y adoptó a Aureliano José
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.62,0:50:25.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,como un hijo que había de acompañar su eterna soledad.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.17,0:50:29.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[fieles] Venga a nosotros tu reino.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.21,0:50:32.79,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Hágase tu voluntad, en la tierra como en el cielo.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.29,0:50:36.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Danos hoy nuestro pan de cada día.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.67,0:50:38.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Perdona nuestras ofensas,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.67,0:50:41.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,como también nosotros perdonamos a los que nos ofenden.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.00,0:50:46.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No nos dejes caer en la tentación y líbranos del mal. Amén.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.79,0:50:50.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Dios te salve, María, llena eres de gracia…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.38,0:50:59.38,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música triste continúa]
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.50,0:51:48.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[campanadas]
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.88,0:52:06.08,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [campanadas continúan] - [música cesa]
Dialogue: 10,0:52:16.04,0:52:20.00,中文,,0,0,0,,乌苏拉下令在哀悼期间紧闭门窗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.04,0:52:20.00,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] de puertas y ventanas cerradas
Dialogue: 10,0:52:20.71,0:52:23.67,中文,,0,0,0,,并且一年内禁止大声说话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.71,0:52:23.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y prohibió hablar en voz alta durante un año.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.33,0:52:36.17,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[puerta se cierra]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.50,0:53:05.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[puerta se cierra]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.67,0:53:18.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ruido sordo]
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.67,0:53:24.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[ruido sordo continúa]
Dialogue: 10,0:54:11.29,0:54:13.58,中文,,0,0,0,,当哀悼持续了好一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:13.62,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador] llevaba tanto tiempo
Dialogue: 10,0:54:13.71,0:54:17.12,中文,,0,0,0,,大家又重新开始刺绣的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.71,0:54:17.12,副字幕,,0,0,0,,que ya se habían reanudado las sesiones de punto y cruz,
Dialogue: 10,0:54:17.79,0:54:21.67,中文,,0,0,0,,一股狂风在下午两点推开了紧闭的家门
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.79,0:54:21.67,副字幕,,0,0,0,,un vendaval empujó la puerta de la calle a las dos de la tarde.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.75,0:54:23.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,- [vendaval] - [puerta se abre]
Dialogue: 10,0:55:00.38,0:55:01.54,中文,,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.38,0:55:01.54,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No puede ser…
Dialogue: 10,0:55:03.83,0:55:05.58,中文,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.83,0:55:05.58,副字幕,,0,0,0,,No puede ser. No puede ser.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:09.46,0:55:10.92,中文,,0,0,0,,是何塞·阿卡蒂奥
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.46,0:55:10.92,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[narrador]
Dialogue: 10,0:55:11.67,0:55:14.04,中文,,0,0,0,,他回来时 如离家时一般穷困
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.67,0:55:14.04,副字幕,,0,0,0,,Regresaba tan pobre como se fue,
Dialogue: 10,0:55:14.62,0:55:17.75,中文,,0,0,0,,就连他那孤身坐在栗子树下的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.62,0:55:17.75,副字幕,,0,0,0,,y hasta su padre bajo el castaño solitario
Dialogue: 10,0:55:18.62,0:55:22.83,中文,,0,0,0,,都感到房子在大地的震动中摇摇欲坠
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.62,0:55:20.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,tuvo la impresión de que un temblor de tierra
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.92,0:55:22.83,副字幕,,0,0,0,,estaba desquiciando la casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.33,0:55:25.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[temblor]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.62,0:55:32.33,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[Úrsula llora]
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.46,0:55:35.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música alegre]
Dialogue: 10,0:55:48.67,0:55:51.00,中文,,0,0,0,,（根据加夫列尔·加西亚·马尔克斯小说改编）
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.46,0:58:01.46,副字幕,,0,0,0,,[música inquietante]
Dialogue: 10,1:01:23.67,1:01:26.08,中文,,0,0,0,,字幕翻译：覃璇
